<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank buys zlotys at above 3.5200 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank buys zlotys at above 3.5200 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought zlotys on the interbank market at above 3.5200 to the dollar, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention could not be immediately confirmed with the National Bank of Poland.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
